WEBVTT

00:00:58.658 --> 00:01:03.026
Troubles my sight: somewhere
in sands of the desert

00:01:03.026 --> 00:01:06.698
A shape with lion body 
and the head of a man,

00:01:06.698 --> 00:01:10.658
A gaze blank and pitiless as the sun,

00:01:10.658 --> 00:01:15.199
Is moving its slow thighs, 
while all about it

00:01:15.209 --> 00:01:20.349
Reel shadows of
the indignant desert birds.

00:01:22.239 --> 00:01:27.899
The darkness drops again; but now I know

00:01:27.899 --> 00:01:31.529
That twenty centuries of stony sleep